                    <span><span class="ch-mega-item-title">Валюты и курсы</span><br><span class="ch-mega-item-sub">Курсы на дату</span></span>
                </a>
                <a class="ch-mega-item" href="#">
                    <span class="ch-mega-item-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="6" width="20" height="12" rx="2" /></svg></span>
                    <span><span class="ch-mega-item-title">Источники финанс-я</span><br><span class="ch-mega-item-sub">Справочник ИФ</span></span>
                </a> *
            </div>

            <div class="ch-launcher-col">
